Article 4 (Submission of Research Plans)
(1) A person falling under any subparagraph of Article 2 who intends to receive research expenses shall submit a research plan specifying the following matters to the Director of the National Police Hospital by the last day of February each year:
1. Position and name of the researcher;
2. Research project;
3. Details of research;
4. Expected commencement and completion dates of research;
5. Details of the use of research expenses;
6. List of research participants (only if there are participants);
7. Other reference matters.
(2) A person who intends to modify any of the matters specified in paragraph (1) 1 through 6 in a research plan approved under Article 5 shall submit an amended research plan to the Director of the National Police Hospital, who shall approve the amended research plan or change the determination of the eligible recipient of research expenses pursuant to Article 5.
